        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:30:09 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Fix Grammar, Rephrase and Summarize no longer refuse text that merely mentions something sensitive ("Couldn't process this text").</li>
    <li>Replace now keeps your line breaks and blank lines instead of joining paragraphs into one line.</li>
    <li>The license key field removes stray spaces and line breaks from a pasted key.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
